6db44834-e800-45fb-87c4-66c0b4896eee	7b00df7f-35b9-4053-940e-65ae1ceb0f1f	State being inconsistent	It has become apparent that managing all of the data within the state has become... unruly. We will need to refactor a lot of how the state is used / managed as we need to account for constantly fluctuating data. This means relying more on our API being much faster and to be making api calls instead of drawing data from our state (no longer persisting data in session storage for items such as tasks, workspaces or teams). Instead the only things persisting in session storage will be user / client specific and we will instead rely on the api for everything else.\n\n- Views pages\n- Settings pages	SQU-156	2024-10-16 13:00:00	4	a83ffea4-ed76-4f31-91a0-b35ed9c33e5d	2024-10-02 10:33:26.969	7b00df7f-35b9-4053-940e-65ae1ceb0f1f	{2df95a83-41da-4bde-85d6-4cdcec56cfae}	done	urgent	3f102a06-9163-4217-87a7-d87cbbaf7ae3	f	2024-10-19 05:16:24.331	\N	e87cdd44-6115-44c8-9aee-c1b12f3207c6	0
